 * (src/pages/mercury-retrograde/index.astro) is the reference: same data
 * logic, markup and styles, with the copy in the reader's language.
 *
 * Links: destinations that exist in the reader's language take the locale
 * prefix. The year page stays English and carries the shared "in English for
 * now" cue. The English page's glossary and planet-guide links sit inside
 * running prose and point at English-only pages, so here the words stay and
 * the links are dropped.
 */
